title: room.enter
---
<<if not $reachedStair>>
The stair turns once and ends at a door, with a thin line of light beneath it.
Watson: Holmes. Listen.
Somewhere below, a single clock is ticking.
Hero: Then someone down there is still keeping time.
Sherlock Holmes in The Stopped Clocks. To be continued.
<<set $reachedStair to true>>
<<endif>>
===

title: room.look
---
Stone steps, worn hollow in the middle. Older than the shop above them.
===

title: light.look
---
Lamplight, under a door. Someone is awake down there.
===

title: light.do
---
Hero: Not yet, Watson. Let us hear what they say before they hear us.
===

title: watson.talk
---
Watson: I'll be right behind you.
===
